  "description": "Max, a now-former captain of the Royal Knights, went on the quest to slay the great monster Medusa. Unfortunately for Max, it ended in great failure, and he ended up being turned to stone. At first, everyone celebrated his great sacrifice, and his statue was placed in the center of the town square. However, after just one week, the town was ready to throw him away. That’s when Eden, an Elf from the mountains, steps in and decides to care for the frozen Max. Eden had always been cold and aloof to him, so what exactly are his intentions with this unexpected kindness…? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Note: Includes 31 extra chapters.*",
